Looking at the question, I need sections that reference section 5.4.3.1 of spec 38.321 (incoming references).

The target is section 5.4.3.1 belonging to spec 38.321. Incoming references means sections where the referencing direction points TO this section. Using rel_REFERENCES_SECTION[["Section","Section"]], src references dst. So I need src sections where dst is the target.

{"query":"SELECT src.\"sectionId\" AS sectionId FROM rel_REFERENCES_SECTION r JOIN \"Section\" tgt ON tgt.node_id=r.dst_id JOIN rel_BELONGS_TO_SPEC bs ON bs.src_id=tgt.node_id JOIN \"Spec\" sp ON sp.node_id=bs.dst_id JOIN \"Section\" src ON src.node_id=r.src_id WHERE tgt.\"sectionNumber\"='5.4.3.1' AND sp.\"specNumber\"='38.321'","abstain":false}
